{"text":"To put this in context, the global economy is consuming or we are consuming 100 million barrels of oil every single day, 100 million barrels. Very often when I have the opportunity to speak to American audiences, I like to put into context that when the American administration, certainly the president talks about releasing new energy supplies through their strategic reserve, he's really talking about 1 million barrels of new supply from their strategic reserves and strategic holdings. But in the broader scheme, as you can clearly see, vis-a-vis the 100 million barrels that are consumed every day, that's really not going to put much of a dent in things. There are many more structural issues that we can get into. Obviously, Russia and Ukraine has made not just fuel but also food prices much more challenging. And that doesn't undermine the fact that we do know that there's about 50 billion tons of emissions that have continued even through the pandemic while we were all at home in quarantine. And that underscores the challenge that the global economy continues to face.","words":[{"text":"To","start":0.0,"end":0.76},{"text":"put","start":0.76,"end":0.96},{"text":"this","start":0.96,"end":1.16},{"text":"in","start":1.16,"end":1.34},{"text":"context","start":1.34,"end":1.92,"punct":","},{"text":"the","start":2.58,"end":2.6},{"text":"global","start":2.6,"end":2.88},{"text":"economy","start":2.88,"end":3.68},{"text":"is","start":3.68,"end":4.04},{"text":"consuming","start":4.04,"end":4.72},{"text":"or","start":4.72,"end":5.04},{"text":"we","start":5.04,"end":5.24},{"text":"are","start":5.24,"end":5.5},{"text":"consuming","start":5.5,"end":6.1},{"text":"100","start":6.1,"end":7.0},{"text":"million","start":7.0,"end":7.56},{"text":"barrels","start":7.56,"end":8.18},{"text":"of","start":8.18,"end":8.56},{"text":"oil","start":8.56,"end":8.84},{"text":"every","start":8.84,"end":9.3},{"text":"single","start":9.3,"end":9.58},{"text":"day","start":9.58,"end":9.92,"punct":"